      "id": "ppj-exec-summary",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "PPJxQSee.AI\n\nDomain:\nQC / TQM\n\nLifecycle:\nOn Hold / Pending Decision\n\nProgress:\nTBD\n\nGate:\nInternal Resource Constraint / Reactivation Criteria Required\n\nOutcome:\nPreserve the QSee QC AI Vision opportunity while holding execution until ownership, resources, dataset readiness, pilot scope and go/no-go authority are confirmed.\n\nTop Blocker:\nQC owner, TQM owner, dataset owner, labeling resources, validation resources, budget and go/no-go authority are not confirmed.\n\nNext Milestone:\nConfirm formal hold status.\n\nLast Verified:\n2026-08-01",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -90,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 560,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ppj-management-attention",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "KEY MANAGEMENT ATTENTION\n\nTop Risks\n- NDA status could be misread as implementation approval.\n- Scheduling work without internal resources would create unmanaged vendor and data commitments.\n\nDecisions Needed\n- Formally approve hold status and reactivation criteria.\n- Confirm whether the vendor has been notified.\n\nExternal Dependencies\n- Confirmed Owners + Dataset + Resources + Pilot Scope + Success Criteria + Budget -> Reactivation Decision",
